# odoo-purchase-orders-secret -- replace values before sealing (integration: odoo-purchase-orders: rest-pull)
# To generate: openssl rand -hex 32   (one value per key; database credentials as the component documents)
# To seal:     ./scripts/convert-to-sealed-secret.sh   (select the overlay; writes secrets/sealed-odoo-purchase-orders-secret.yaml)
# Secret name: odoo-purchase-orders-secret   namespace: uc-invoice-intake   keys: ODOO_PURCHASE_ORDERS_TOKEN
ODOO_PURCHASE_ORDERS_TOKEN=CHANGE_ME
